## Most Used Commands

### MacBook
```bash
# apply your config changes
home-manager switch --flake ~/.config/home-manager

# shortcut alias
hms

# edit your config
nano ~/.config/home-manager/home.nix
```

### Dell
```bash
# dry run — check for errors without applying (always do this first)
sudo nixos-rebuild dry-run --flake /etc/nixos#nixos-test

# apply config changes (system + home-manager)
sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake /etc/nixos#nixos-test

# edit system config
sudo nano /etc/nixos/configuration.nix

# edit user config
sudo nano /etc/nixos/home.nix
```

### Git (both machines)
```bash
git add .                        # stage all changes
git commit -m "description"      # save a snapshot with a message
git push                         # send to GitHub
git pull                         # get changes from GitHub
git status                       # see what has changed
git log --oneline                # see commit history
```

### Nix Housekeeping
```bash
# remove old generations to free disk space
nix-collect-garbage -d

# update flake inputs to latest versions
nix flake update  # run from your config directory

# search for a package
nix search nixpkgs packagename
```

